Add fuzz testing for project_load.

Use libFuzzer or AFL to fuzz the project JSON parser with random inputs.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Fuzz harness for sq_project_load() created
- [ ] Harness accepts arbitrary byte input as project data
- [ ] Corpus seeded with valid .sqproj files
- [ ] Runs for at least 10 minutes without crashes
- [ ] Any crashes found are fixed

## Test Plan
- [ ] Build fuzz target with -fsanitize=fuzzer,address
- [ ] Run fuzzer with seed corpus, verify no crashes after 10 min
- [ ] Triage and fix any crash inputs found
